commit c64e97484f892f898e977de4cc254376dd697bba

C03: a weather search report is grounded in the pages found (WEB1447)

WEB1445 measured the local weather searches: four verified with five forecast index pages whose snippets carry no values, and the finals invented «buen tiempo, temperaturas agradables, poco viento y baja probabilidad de lluvia» or denied having any information; over a failed search another final asserted «Sí, va a llover mañana».

baxy_mind llm: for a verified web.search, _search_unsupported_claim vetoes a weather assertion (conditions, temperatures, rain, «hace buen tiempo»…) that no result states verbatim; for weather lookups _search_unsupported_terms vetoes content words absent from the results and the request (news summaries keep their latitude and the WEB1271 finals still pass); search_result_denied vetoes «no tengo información» over verified results; each veto carries a hint, and the instruction tells the composer to name the pages found by title and site and never state a forecast the results do not contain.
baxy_mind observed_response_literals and Baxy.App ObservedResponseLiterals: result titles and hosts («tiempo.cl», «eltiempoen.com») are observed names, not dotted operation names.

Offline probe on the WEB1445 receipts: the three invented finals and the denial are vetoed; the faithful report of the pages found passes; the four credited WEB1271 news finals still pass. App recompiled (BUILD1447). Tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


